Of the 128 ASCII characters, a name may start with these 53:
ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ_abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz
and hold these 63 after its first character:
0123456789ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ_abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz

Past ASCII, 13 of these 13 letters, digits, marks and spaces are refused anywhere in a name:
é ß π Ж ك 中 ア ١ ² ℕ 𝑥 · <160>
